#1194 is fixed and committed as 18296f08. yoyo config get max_tokens now shows the real value, and api_key is still hidden as ***. Build, all tests, clippy with -D warnings and the fmt check all pass.

The cause: is_secret_key in src/commands_config.rs hid any key whose name merely contained token, key, secret or password. So max_tokens, which is just the output limit, came out as ***.

The fix: it now splits the key name on _, - and ., and hides a value when a part ends in key(s), token, secret(s), password, passwd or credential(s), or when the whole name contains secret, password or apikey.
• I used "ends in" rather than "equals" so names written as one word stay hidden (AccessToken, githubtoken). An existing test already required AccessToken to be hidden.
• Plural tokens is left out on purpose: in a config key it names a count, not a credential.
• One known trade: a part that is exactly key is still hidden, even in a made-up name like key_bindings_file. Hiding too much is the harmless direction. I had added that name as a "must show" row, saw it fail, and decided the row was wrong rather than the rule.

Tests (in src/commands_config_get_tests.rs):
• Every known key: the test takes all keys from SETTABLE_KEYS and TOP_LEVEL_KEYS (30 after removing duplicates). Before the fix, the hidden ones were {api_key, max_tokens}; now only api_key is. This test failed on the old code before I changed it.
• Name table: 13 names that must be hidden (including GITHUB_TOKEN, x-api-key, aws.secret_access_key) and 7 that must be shown (including max_tokens, MaxTokens, max_output_tokens, keymap).
• Full output check: config get max_tokens prints exactly   max_tokens = 2048  (src), and api_key prints ***.
• No test had been asserting max_tokens = ***. One test avoided the bug by using max_turns instead, with a comment saying why; I removed that comment.

Run against the freshly built binary (temporary HOME, .yoyo.toml containing max_tokens = 2048 and api_key = "x"):
```
$ yoyo config get max_tokens
  max_tokens = 2048  (.yoyo.toml)
$ yoyo config show
  api_key     = ***
  max_tokens  = 2048
```

src/commands_config.rs is now 2042 lines. That is over the 2000-line limit, but inside the 50-line grace allowance, so the module-size check passes with a warning. The next change to that file has 8 lines of room before the check fails.
